+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    The DVR link-local and rule-priority allocators shared by every router on
+    an L3 agent are now locked and write their state files atomically, so
+    concurrent router processing can no longer hand out a duplicate
+    allocation or leave a partly written state file.
